  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **In The Flesh (Pink Floyd)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Thin Ice (Pink Floyd)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Dirty Deeds (AC/DC)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance; with Guy Heller on vox [2]\n- **Candyman (Grateful Dead)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Auld Lang Syne**: back after 176 archived shows (1461 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Rocking In The Free World (Neil Young)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Fire (Jimi Hendrix)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Springtheme**: with BogadaciousG on vox [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **Ween2002-12-31** (recommended): source not stated; 18 songs; 152 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Guests: BogadaciousG on vox, Guy Heller on vox [1]\n- Lineup lists Dean Ween on guitar, Mean Ween on bass, Rev B-Ill on guitar, and two drummers, Josh and Claude [1]\n- Vocals credited to Guy Heller and BogadaciousG, with additional unidentified guitar and bass players also taking part [1]",
